model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
kind savings: place PLN min 0
place konto: savings lives 2025-01-01..
input wd: date
input owns[p in parties, x in places]: num
input wa: money PLN
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
kind pays: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
move wage: pays
  on wd
  leg cash from world to konto amount wa

ask a: wa

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  wd = 2026-02-01
  wa = 100.00 PLN
  owns[ania, konto] = 1
